    <h1 class="article-title">How to Remove Metadata from a PDF</h1>
    <p class="article-subtitle">Your PDF is carrying information you never chose to share. Here is every method to remove it &mdash; from a 30-second browser tool to command-line forensic stripping.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
